Run this complete example in a fresh database.
```sql
CREATE TABLE tiles(colour TEXT);
INSERT INTO tiles VALUES('blue'),('red'),('gold');
CREATE TEMP VIEW shown AS
SELECT colour
FROM tiles
WHERE colour IN('blue','gold');
SELECT *
FROM shown
ORDER BY colour;
```

